WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.980
Pinky here! Here's a question that looks impossible.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.040
Four scores. You don't know any of them,

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.160
just their average.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:10.620
Add one more.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.240
What's the new average?

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:13.840
Totally doable.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.940
The mean is the total,

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.420
divided by how many.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.440
Which means: mean times how many gets you the total back.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.820
Four scores average twelve.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.600
Picture four bars,

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.800
all leveled at twelve.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.660
So the total is four times twelve:

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:32.880
forty-eight.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.060
Add a score of seventeen.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.840
New total: forty-eight plus seventeen,

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.940
sixty-five. New count:

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.880
five. Sixty-five divided by five is thirteen.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:48.040
Your turn. Three scores average ten.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.480
Add an eighteen.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.600
What's the new mean?

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.420
Go.

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.670
Twelve! Thirty plus eighteen is forty-eight,

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:02.930
divided by four.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:05.370
See what we skipped?

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:07.810
We never needed the original scores.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:10.070
Recover the old total first,

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:11.330
and the rest is easy.

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:14.010
Now the trap:

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:17.650
averaging two averages when the groups aren't the same size.

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:19.770
Two students average ninety.

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:21.670
Eight students average seventy.

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:24.130
The class average is not eighty.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:28.550
Use totals. One eighty plus five sixty is seven forty,

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.370
over ten: seventy-four.

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:33.470
When you add a value,

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:35.750
update both the total and the count.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.850
Now hit Try this skill,

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:39.150
and go get 'em!
